--- !u!114 &158
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 11}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 65d4c1103c5d4e42731ff2b51017df77, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  enabled: 1
  lines:
  - '* whoa,^05 you guys almost\n  looked like you were\n  gonna jump at me.'
  - '* did you find an\n  evil doppelganger or\n  somethin''?'
  - '* ...^05 Yeah.'
  - '* well,^05 maybe you should\n  know about some special\n  attacks.'
  - '* if you see a <color=#00A2E8FF>blue\n  attack</color>,^05 don''t move and\n  it won''t hurt you.'
  - '* here''s an easy way to\n  keep it in mind.'
  - '* imagine a stop sign.^10\n* when you see a stop\n  sign,^05 you <color=#FF0000FF>stop,</color>^05 right?'
  - '* stop signs are <color=#FF0000FF>red</color>.\n* so imagine a <color=#00A2E8FF>blue</color> stop\n  sign instead.'
  - '* simple,^05 right?^10\n* when fighting,^05 think\n  about <color=#FFFF00FF>blue stop signs</color>.'
  - '* Okay,^05 that would''ve\n  been nice to know in\n  the last place we were.'
  - '* But uhh...^05 what about\n  those orange bullets we\n  just saw?'
  - '* well,^05 for <color=#FCA600FF>orange attacks</color>,^05\n  think of that <color=#FF0000FF>stop sign</color>\n  again.'
  - '* <color=#FCA600FF>orange</color> is the opposite\n  of <color=#00A2E8FF>blue</color>,^05 right?'
  - '* so do the <color=#00FF00FF>opposite\n  of stop</color>.'
  - '* ... or in other words,^05\n  <color=#00FF00FF>move through it</color>.'
  - '* hope that helps.'
  sounds:
  - snd_txtsans
  - snd_txtsans
  - snd_txtsus
  - snd_txtsans
  - snd_txtsans
  - snd_txtsans
  - snd_txtsans
  - snd_txtsans
  - snd_txtsans
  - snd_txtsus
  - snd_txtsus
  - snd_txtsans
  - snd_txtsans
  - snd_txtsans
  - snd_txtsans
  speed: 00000000
  portraits:
  - sans_neutral
  - sans_side
  - su_side_sweat
  - sans_wink
  - sans_neutral
  - sans_neutral
  - sans_neutral
  - sans_neutral
  - sans_neutral
  - su_inquisitive
  - su_neutral
  - sans_side
  - sans_neutral
  - sans_neutral
  - sans_side
  - sans_wink
  remarks: []
  left:
  leftOffset: {x: 0, y: 0}
  right:
  rightOffset: {x: 0, y: 0}
  up:
  upOffset: {x: 0, y: 0}
  down:
  downOffset: {x: 0, y: 0}
  centerOffset: {x: 0, y: 0}
  talkSprites: []
  talkFramerate: 6
  shopObject: {fileID: 1423781266907335, guid: bbe849078ab5d0a41bf5ac5c9db5c7af, type: 2}
